#API list

@rootUrl = http://localhost:8080

###check server status

GET {{rootUrl}}


### AUTH API

###post new user
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fName": "Johnn",
  "lName": "Doeee",
  "email": "sdnbasnet@gmail.com",
  "password": "aaAA@@11"
  
}

###post Activate user
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/activate-user
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "6a44db91ef479962490af5cb",
  "t": "815588b7-7427-400e-9f16-a1e51588565c"

}


###Login User

POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{

  "email": "sdnbasnet@gmail.com",
  "password": "aaAA@@11"
  
}



###get User

GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InNkbmJhc25ldEBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODIzNTQ1MTYsImV4cCI6MTc4MjM1NTQxNn0.3NS24yLTTp6EjM1uviZs-5yfUjBgwXqG0TPi5k8KmkI


###renew accessJWT
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/renew-jwt
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InNkbmJhc25ldEBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODIzNTYxNjUsImV4cCI6MTc4NDk0ODE2NX0.lyyt3OSzfPdQyGOCOcCvwxQTRTvbZP4x00F_4v0Jjzo

###OTP request
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"sdnbasnet@gmail.com"
}

###reset password request
POST {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email":"sdnbasnet@gmail.com",
  "password":"aaAA@@1111",
  "otp":9167
}


#### BookAPI

###GET books for public
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books

###GET books for admin
GET {{rootUrl}}/api/v1/books/admin
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InNkbmJhc25ldEBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3ODMxNzM2ODAsImV4cCI6MTc4MzE3NDU4MH0.A0CRYhIrLbTIjvKSGfjnOlmVkXH99bd3ktjhz_Q8rgI

